Subject: Qualify host build scripts and proc macros in the SDK consumer

The normal no-build-std consumer invokes a host proc macro with a build
script that verifies the pinned compiler commit and host triple. Retain its
receipt separately from target link/runtime qualification. Use recursive
receipt discovery for the pinned Cargo build-directory layout.
Base: preceding patches on PR1800 2eb81b4. APL 1.1, AROS contributors;
original consumer pipeline copyright John KNIPPER.

